Package: emaki
Type: Package
Title: Generate 'Seedance' Videos and Images with 'emaki'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("emaki", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "support@emaki.ai")
Description: Official SDK for 'emaki' <https://emaki.ai>, the Japanese-language
    AI video generator for 'Seedance' 2.5 and 'Seedance' 2.0. Submit
    text-to-video, image-to-video and image runs with your 'emaki' API key,
    wait for the result URL, and check your remaining credits.
